On offer
    Show quest "You're gonna get. Now is your last chance to change the war situation. If successful, this friendly'll rise again.\n\nI'll give you the last order. You have to seal [Devil 5] President Marbas, who has great fame even in Hell. He's a high-ranked devil who governs thirty-six legions. He's very dangerous and need to be watched for, because he can cause and spread diseases. Go to [Eslant] with the [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] and destroy him after summoning him from the [Devil 5 Summoning Stone]. We'll have a chance to counterattack if he's removed.\n\nYou have to receive [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] from [Order of the sorcery] Bros, of Ronark Land. Then, summon [Devil 5] Marbas from [Devil 5 Summoning Stone] at Luferson Castle area and kill him. \n※ [Devil 5 Summoning Scroll] is free the first time, but from the next time on you'll have to pay a million Noahs."

